  "ruleText": "Ahp 103.01 The Office of Licensed Allied Health Professionals. The office of licensed allied health professionals shall work with the board of directors to coordinate the work of the governing boards.\n\nSource. #7401, eff 11-3-00; ss by #8077, eff 5-1-04; ss by #9517, eff 7-24-09; ss by #12724, eff 2-15-19; ss by #13626, eff 6-24-23",
